  - family-names: Shardlow
    given-names: Matthew
abstract: >-
  An expert-annotated dataset for fine-grained named entity recognition in
  vehicle advertisements: 659 car listings annotated with 4,609 entity spans
  across 15 vehicle-specification types, plus a three-annotator
  inter-annotator agreement study on 100 documents.
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/FilipposVentirozos/AutoSpecNER"
keywords:
  - named entity recognition
  - NER
  - dataset
  - annotated corpus
  - natural language processing
  - information extraction
  - automotive
  - vehicle specifications
  - IOB2
  - inter-annotator agreement
